  "title": "Hurricane Maria: Chinooks bring food and water to Coamo (60 sec)",
  "description": "U.S. Army Soldiers from the 2nd General Support Aviation Battalion, 501st Aviation Regiment, Homeland Security personnel, and U.S. Air Force Airmen pack food and water into two CH-47 Chinooks to give the supplies to Puerto Ricans in Coamo Arriba Barrio, Puerto Rico, Oct. 19, 2017. The Federal Emergency Management Agency and its federal partners continue 24-hour operations to conduct life-saving rescue and medical missions. (US Air Force video by Airman 1st Class Franklin Harris)",
